  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCorporation Tax\n\t\tCorporation Tax Help Guide\n\n### How to change tax-due document template\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 2 Jun, 2023 at  2:44 PM\n\n\t\tTo format a tax-due document template within the Corporation Tax module. \n\nNavigation: Corporation Tax > General settings > Document templates\n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to format a tax-due template using the 'Edit' button, and adding relevant tags.\n\nOnce the process is complete, a user is required to click the 'Save' button to apply all the changes made. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
